2026-07-27T08:14:16.6686250Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6686733Z i /tmp/RtmpzYvwil/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6687061Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6687431Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6687969Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6688454Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6689153Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6689682Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:14:16.6979960Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:16.7103905Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:16.7639004Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:16.7847739Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
